id: bestial-presence
name: Bestial Presence
order: 4
category: body
importance: secondary
# (1) Up to two Bestial Traits, each chosen as it is added - "Later, by hand" for none - and the Racial Life Modifier 1 lower for each it
# gave, while it is had (actor-character.mjs).
grantsOther: bestial
grantsOtherCount: 2
grantedLifeCost: 1
description: >
  Animals always create a tense atmosphere around them with their unpredictability and their deadly defense mechanisms.
text: >
  Bestial Presence (Body): Animals always create a tense atmosphere around them with their unpredictability and their deadly defense mechanisms.
  (1)-[Passive]: Select and gain up to 2 Bestial Traits. For every Bestial Trait gained through this effect, reduce your Racial Life Modifier by 1.
  (2)-[Triggered/Power, 1/Round]: Make a Clash (Intimidate vs Intuition/Intimidate) against all Opponents within a Destructive Sphere AoE (centered on you). If you win, they gain a stack of the Broken Combat Condition and the Shaken Combat Condition until the start of your next turn.

---

# (2) The Power Up used: the Clash against every Opponent within a Destructive Sphere - won, Broken and Shaken till the start of your
# next turn (chat.mjs bestialPresence). Ticked in its window.
[triggered/power, 1/round, effect 2]
bestialPresence();
